---
title: "service_startup_lifecycle (docker-compose.yml: bot service)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_build: docker build from Dockerfile
    q_build --> q_load_env: build success
    q_load_env --> q_set_env: load .env file
    q_set_env --> q_configure: NODE_ENV = production
    q_configure --> q_expose: expose port 3000:3000
    q_expose --> q_start: start container
    q_start --> [*]: service running

    q_build --> q_error: build failure
    q_error --> [*]: deployment aborted

    note right of q_load_env
        INV-001: .env file must exist at deployment time
        INV-002: env_file loaded before explicit environment overrides
    end note

    note right of q_expose
        INV-003: host port 3000 maps to container port 3000
        INV-004: port binding exposes service to all network interfaces
    end note

    note right of q_set_env
        INV-005: NODE_ENV = production overrides any .env value
    end note
